                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Top"} Top
                  a monomorphism is just a continuous injective function, whereas the strong and regular monomorphisms coincide and are the subspace embeddings. In some contexts at least, one can argue that subspace embeddings are a more appropriate notion of “subobject” in
